            "主界面提供语言和界面外观的选择。关闭主面板后，应用会继续在顶部菜单栏后台运行。": "Choose a language and appearance on the main screen. The menu-bar app can remain open in the background.",
            "请在系统设置的「隐私与安全性」中，为 V-Mouse鼠标映射 开启「辅助功能」和「输入监控」权限。如果更新应用后权限失效，请在系统设置中删掉旧条目后重新添加。": "Add and enable the current V-Mouse鼠标映射 app in Accessibility and Input Monitoring. If permissions stop working after an update, remove the old V-Mouse entry and add the current app again.",
            "在按键映射中点击「读取」，并在 20 秒内连续按 3 次目标侧键。对于 DPI± 键，如果它们仍是默认的调节灵敏度功能，将无法被读取；请先在 Windows 电脑上将它们改为普通按键（例如字母 P），然后再到 Mac 上进行读取。": "Open Button Mapping, choose Learn Mouse Button Definitions, then press each desired mouse source three times within 20 seconds. Default private DPI± signals need not be learned; assign ordinary onboard values in Windows first when required.",
            "读取来源后，您可以将其映射为键盘、鼠标、系统快捷键、打开应用或执行命令等。开启「拦截原键」将阻断鼠标原本的输出并执行您的映射；关闭则让原键直接通过。": "Edit a source and choose Keyboard, Mouse, Mac Shortcuts, Open, Command, Text, or Profile. Enable Block Original only for sources that should not pass through their onboard action.",
            "滚轮增强功能专门针对鼠标滚轮优化，丝毫不影响触控板的原生体验。您可以独立调节平滑度、滚动方向、速度以及设置各种长按快捷键。": "Scroll enhancement affects mouse-wheel events only. Smoothing, direction, speed, and hold shortcuts can be adjusted independently from button mapping.",
            "您可以创建、复制、导入和导出多套配置。V-Mouse鼠标映射 仅在 Mac 软件层面工作，绝对不会改写您鼠标的板载硬件内存，保障您的鼠标在 Windows 和 Mac 下各自独立完美运行。": "Profiles can be created, duplicated, imported, and exported. The app never writes mouse onboard configuration; Windows and macOS usage remain independent.",
            "V-Mouse鼠标映射 需要辅助功能权限才能重映射按键。\n\n请在以下位置添加 V-Mouse鼠标映射：\n系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能\n\n授予权限后，您可能需要重启应用。": "V-Mouse鼠标映射 needs Accessibility permission to remap buttons.\n\nAdd V-Mouse鼠标映射 in:\nSystem Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility\n\nYou may need to restart the app after granting permission."
